From 56c91fee139f861b17de236b26bcf028b0c2d512 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Rogers <gnathonic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:18:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] animejanai: fused winograd43 conv for non-coopmat GPUs,
 SpabTail fused layer, GridSample Vulkan layer

- convolution_vulkan: single-dispatch fused winograd F(4x4,3x3) (transforms staged in LDS, no
  VRAM intermediates) for pack4 fp16 3x3 s1 pad-1 convs with <=64 output channels. Default on
  GPUs without cooperative matrix and on AMD; NCNN_WINO_FUSED=0/1/2 to disable/enable/force.
  RX 6900 XT 960x540 64->64: 2.75 -> 1.01 ms; RX 9070 XT: 1.97 (coopmat) -> 1.33 ms.
- SpabTail layer: out = (res + x) * tanh(W1x1 x + b) in one pass (SPAN SPAB block tail).
- net.cpp: NCNN_DISPATCH_THRESHOLD env overrides the mid-forward flush threshold (profiling).
- GridSample Vulkan layer (RIFE warps) that was previously uncommitted in this tree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
